 professor David, they are taking the database course.\n\n5.**All students working in the lab are instructed by professor David.**.\n   - This means if a student works in the lab, they are instructed by professor David.\n\n6.**James is a student working in the lab.**.\n   - From point 5, since James works in the lab, he is instructed by professor David.\n\n7.**All students instructed by professor David are taking the database course.**.\n   - Since James is instructed by professor David, he is taking the database course.\n\n8.**All students who take the database course are from the computer science department.**.James neither takes the database course nor has a part-time job offered by the university.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
