messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAll horses have hooves. No humans have hooves.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Some humans are horses.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', '<think>.\nTo determine the truth value of the statement "Some humans are horses" based on the given context, we need to carefully analyze the information provided and apply logical reasoning.\n\n1.**Context Analysis:**.\n   - All horses have hooves.\n   - No humans have hooves.\n\n2.**Statement to Evaluate:**.\n   - "Some humans are horses.".\n\n3.**Logical Reasoning:**.\n   - The context tells us that all horses have hooves.\n   - The context also tells us that no humans have hooves.\n   - If a being has hooves, it must be a horse (since all horses have hooves).\n   - If a being does not have hooves, it cannot be a horse (since no humans have hooves).\n\n4.**Implications:**.\n   - Since all humans have hooves, it is possible for any human to be a horse.\n   - Therefore, it is possible for "some humans to be horses.".\n\n5.**Conclusion:**.\n   - The statement "Some humans are horses" is true because it aligns with the given information that all humans have hooves.\n\nThus, the correct answer is:.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
