t Roland Garros 2022.\n\n2.**Identifying Key Points:**.\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA, and Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (from the given condition), Coco Gauff must be a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n   - Since Coco Gauff is a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, she lost to Iga Świątek (as all female players lost to Iga Świątek).\n   - Since Coco Gauff lost to Iga Świątek, she is ranked highly by the WTA (as everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA).\n   - Since Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the WTA, she is among the most active players in major tennis (as per the given condition).\nThe statement "Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
