ock might not breathe (as not all non-animals do).\n- Rock might fly (as per the conditional statement).\n\nNow, let\'s consider the possibility of Rock not having wings:.\n- The context does not provide any information about Rock not having wings.\n- The only information we have is that Rock is not an animal and might fly.\n\nSince the context does not give any information about Rock not having wings, and we know Rock might fly, we cannot definitively conclude that Rock does not have wings.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Rock has wings" is uncertain based on the given information.\n\n<｜Assistant｜> <answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
